          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasimumpa Satana",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lipesa kuti amgwisye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mundu juŵaliji mkwiŵa, akasajiŵa soni nambo atande kamula masengo mwakulimbika ni kutenda yambone ni makono gakwe, kuti apate kandu kakwapa ŵakulaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkamwa mwenu mukasimukopoka maloŵe galigose gakusakala, nambo mŵeceteje maloŵe ago pego gagali gambone ni kulimbikasya mitima mpela mugakusosecela, kuti acimjenu ŵakugapikana maloŵego apindule nago. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkasimdandawulisya Msimu Ŵaswela ŵiŵaŵisile Mlungu cimanyisyo cakwe cakusimicisya kuti jemanja mli wakwe pa lisiku litacimkulupusya Mlungujo kusyesyene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkutyosye pasikati penu kuŵengana, kukalipa, nipo soni kupya mtima. Mkasimtenda njojo kapena kuŵeceta maloŵe gacipongwe, soni paŵeje pangali kusakala kwine kulikose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EPH 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "M'malo mwakwe, mnonyelaneje ni kutendelana canasa nipo ni kululucilanaga jwine ni mjakwe mpela muŵamkululucile Mlungu mwa Klistu jemanja mula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EPH.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EPH.4.32"
            ]
          }
